{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ9QSqWYktqNGcA9wrCZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018Q4LHZbjFdq7XwvQf2mnvw","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-014-hkX63b/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>课程价格 · 开口英语</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\">开口<span>英语</span></a>\n      <nav class=\"topnav\" aria-label=\"页面导航\">\n        <a href=\"#one-on-one\">一对一</a>\n        <a href=\"#group\">小班课</a>\n        <a href=\"#compare\">怎么选</a>\n        <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"intro wrap\">\n      <div class=\"measure-prose\">\n        <h1>课程价格</h1>\n        <p>按课时购买，课时包有效期内随时约课。第一次上课前可以免费试听一节，确认老师和节奏合适再付款。</p>\n      </div>\n      <nav class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"课程类型\">\n        <a href=\"#one-on-one\">一对一</a>\n        <a href=\"#group\">小班课</a>\n      </nav>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"track wrap\" id=\"one-on-one\" aria-labelledby=\"t1\">\n      <div class=\"track-head\">\n        <div class=\"measure-prose\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">一对一</span>\n          <h2 id=\"t1\">一对一外教课</h2>\n          <p>整节课只围绕你一个人：老师根据你的目标定话题，随时纠正发音和用词。适合要准备面试、出差、考试口语，或者想快速突破的学员。</p>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"facts\">\n          <li><b>50 分钟</b><small>每节时长</small></li>\n          <li><b>1 位老师</b><small>可固定也可更换</small></li>\n          <li><b>早 7 点至晚 11 点</b><small>可约时段</small></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"plans\">\n        <article class=\"plan\">\n          <h3>入门包 · 10 课时</h3>\n          <p class=\"for\">先上一段时间，看看自己适合什么节奏。</p>\n          <p class=\"price\"><span class=\"cur\">¥</span><span class=\"num\">2,380</span></p>\n          <p class=\"unit\">每节 <strong>¥238</strong> · 有效期 3 个月</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>入学口语水平测评</li>\n            <li>每节课后的文字反馈</li>\n            <li>提前 6 小时可免费改约</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#trial\">选这个</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan pick\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">多数学员的选择</span>\n          <h3>进阶包 · 30 课时</h3>\n          <p class=\"for\">每周两到三节，大约三个月能明显感到说得更顺。</p>\n          <p class=\"price\"><span class=\"cur\">¥</span><span class=\"num\">6,480</span></p>\n          <p class=\"unit\">每节 <strong>¥216</strong> · 有效期 6 个月</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>包含入门包全部内容</li>\n            <li>按目标定制的课程计划</li>\n            <li>每 10 节一次进度复盘</li>\n            <li>课堂录音回放</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#trial\">选这个</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan\">\n          <h3>长期包 · 60 课时</h3>\n          <p class=\"for\">把口语练成习惯，单价最低。</p>\n          <p class=\"price\"><span class=\"cur\">¥</span><span class=\"num\">11,880</span></p>\n          <p class=\"unit\">每节 <strong>¥198</strong> · 有效期 12 个月</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>包含进阶包全部内容</li>\n            <li>专属学习顾问</li>\n            <li>可暂停一次，最长 30 天</li>\n            <li>可转赠给家人使用</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#trial\">选这个</a>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"note\">价格含税。课时包未使用的部分，开课后 14 天内可按剩余课时退款。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"track wrap\" id=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"t2\">\n      <div class=\"track-head\">\n        <div class=\"measure-prose\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">小班课</span>\n          <h2 id=\"t2\">4–6 人小班课</h2>\n          <p>同水平的同学一起练，按主题轮流发言、做情景对话。开口机会比大课多，价格比一对一低一半以上，适合想坚持每周练习的学员。</p>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"facts\">\n          <li><b>60 分钟</b><small>每节时长</small></li>\n          <li><b>4–6 人</b><small>按水平分班</small></li>\n          <li><b>每周固定时间</b><small>工作日晚和周末</small></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"plans\">\n        <article class=\"plan\">\n          <h3>月度班 · 12 节</h3>\n          <p class=\"for\">每周三节，一个月完成一个主题单元。</p>\n          <p class=\"price\"><span class=\"cur\">¥</span><span class=\"num\">1,188</span></p>\n          <p class=\"unit\">每节 <strong>¥99</strong> · 有效期 2 个月</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>开班前分级测试</li>\n            <li>每节课的讲义和词表</li>\n            <li>缺课可补到同级别其他班</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#trial\">选这个</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan pick\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">性价比最高</span>\n          <h3>季度班 · 24 节</h3>\n          <p class=\"for\">完整学完一个级别，结课有口语测评。</p>\n          <p class=\"price\"><span class=\"cur\">¥</span><span class=\"num\">2,136</span></p>\n          <p class=\"unit\">每节 <strong>¥89</strong> · 有效期 4 个月</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>包含月度班全部内容</li>\n            <li>结课口语测评和报告</li>\n            <li>赠送 1 节一对一纠音课</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#trial\">选这个</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan\">\n          <h3>年度班 · 48 节</h3>\n          <p class=\"for\">连续升两个级别，单节价格最低。</p>\n          <p class=\"price\"><span class=\"cur\">¥</span><span class=\"num\">3,792</span></p>\n          <p class=\"unit\">每节 <strong>¥79</strong> · 有效期 8 个月</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>包含季度班全部内容</li>\n            <li>赠送 3 节一对一纠音课</li>\n            <li>可中途换到其他时段的班</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#trial\">选这个</a>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"note\">开班后人数不足 4 人时，课时照常进行，不额外收费。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"compare wrap\" id=\"compare\" aria-labelledby=\"t3\">\n      <h2 id=\"t3\">一对一还是小班课？</h2>\n      <div class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"col\"></th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">一对一</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">小班课</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">每节价格</th>\n              <td>¥198–238</td>\n              <td>¥79–99</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">每节时长</th>\n              <td>50 分钟</td>\n              <td>60 分钟</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">你的开口时间</th>\n              <td>约 30 分钟</td>\n              <td>约 12–15 分钟</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">上课时间</th>\n              <td>自己约，早 7 点至晚 11 点</td>\n              <td>每周固定时段</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">课程内容</th>\n              <td>按你的目标定制</td>\n              <td>按级别的主题教材</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">适合谁</th>\n              <td>有明确目标、时间不固定、想尽快提高</td>\n              <td>预算有限、想有同伴一起坚持</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"faq wrap\" id=\"faq\" aria-labelledby=\"t4\">\n      <div class=\"measure-prose\">\n        <h2 id=\"t4\">常见问题</h2>\n        <details>\n          <summary>试听课怎么约？</summary>\n          <p>点页面下方的“预约免费试听”，填写手机号后，课程顾问会在一个工作日内联系你安排时间。一对一和小班课都可以试听，每人限一次。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>临时有事不能上课怎么办？</summary>\n          <p>一对一课提前 6 小时改约不扣课时；小班课可以补到同级别其他时段的班。不足 6 小时取消的一对一课会扣除一节。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>可以从小班课换到一对一吗？</summary>\n          <p>可以。剩余的小班课时按购买时的单价折算成金额，抵扣一对一课时包的费用，差价补齐即可。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>老师都是外教吗？</summary>\n          <p>一对一和小班课的主讲老师都以英语为母语，并持有英语教学证书。纠音课由中教和外教搭配，方便用中文解释发音要点。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>能开发票吗？</summary>\n          <p>可以开具电子普通发票，付款后在“我的订单”里申请，三个工作日内发到邮箱。</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"wrap\" id=\"trial\">\n      <div class=\"trial\">\n        <div>\n          <h2>先上一节试听课</h2>\n          <p>25 分钟，免费，课后给你一份口语水平报告。</p>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"btn solid\" href=\"#trial\">预约免费试听</a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"wrap\">价格更新于 2026 年 10 月，以下单页面显示为准。</div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3873,"cache_read_input_tokens":48525,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3873},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f4e4a37c-1961-4746-9e17-4001987c6c47","uuid":"ba6bf639-0bf8-43b7-a485-41544f19d4ab","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:34:19.925Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ9QSWgJM23AM94Q7qWZ","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_018Q4LHZbjFdq7XwvQf2mnvw":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-014-hkX63b/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>课程价格 · 开口英语</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\">开口<span>英语</span></a>\n      <nav class=\"topnav\" aria-label=\"页面导航\">\n        <a href=\"#one-on-one\">一对一</a>\n        <a href=\"#group\">小班课</a>\n        <a href=\"#compare\">怎么选</a>\n        <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"intro wrap\">\n      <div class=\"measure-prose\">\n        <h1>课程价格</h1>\n        <p>按课时购买，课时包有效期内随时约课。第一次上课前可以免费试听一节，确认老师和节奏合适再付款。</p>\n      </div>\n      <nav class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"课程类型\"